@startuml post-info
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/v1/user/student/info
caption CRB-31 · 재학생 추가 정보 저장 · 수정 (바뀌었을 때만 새 버전), 연락 설정, 가입 완료 시 토큰 재발급

actor Client
participant "SignupStepGuard\nUserTypeGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "StudentController" as Controller
participant "StudentService" as Service
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepository
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepository
participant "DepartmentRepository" as DepartmentRepository
participant "StudentProfileRepository" as ProfileRepository
participant "StudentProfileAttachmentRepository" as AttachmentRepository
participant "CoffeeChatContactRepository" as ContactRepository
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: POST /api/v1/user/student/info\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>\n{ name?, department_id, interests, activities?, attachments?, contact }
ref over Client, Guard
  SignupStepGuard → UserTypeGuard — flow/auth-guards.puml
  @SignupStep({ step: "profile", allowActive: true })
  pending: next_step = profile 일 때만 / active: 항상 통과 (마이페이지 수정)
  @UserTypes("student")
  401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / User not found
  403 Signup step mismatch / User type not allowed
end ref
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt body 검증 실패
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
note right of Pipe
  name 1~64자 / department_id 정수
  interests 1~20개, 각 1~50자, 중복 불가 / activities 0~20개, 각 1~50자
  attachments 최대 10개: kind cv | portfolio, source = link 만 (file 은 CRB-38),
    url http(s) 2048자 이하
  contact: email_enabled · kakao_enabled boolean, email 형식,
    phone 은 "-" · 공백 제거 후 01로 시작하는 10~11자리
end note
Pipe -> Controller: saveInfo(req, user)
Controller -> Service: saveInfo(userPk, req)

alt contact.email_enabled = false 이고 kakao_enabled = false
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 At least one contact method is required
else email_enabled 인데 contact.email 없음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Contact email is required
else kakao_enabled 인데 contact.phone 없음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Contact phone is required
end
note right of Service: 재학생은 "희망하지 않음"(둘 다 false)을 고를 수 없음

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> UserRepository: findByPkForUpdate(userPk, tx)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT users WHERE pk = ? AND is_deleted = false\nAND withdraw_requested_at IS NULL FOR UPDATE
  PostgreSQL --> UserRepository: row
  UserRepository --> Service: user | null
  alt 유저 없음 (가드 통과 직후 탈퇴 요청)
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 401 User not found
  end
  note right of Service
    같은 유저의 동시 저장을 직렬화해서 같은 version 을 두 번 insert 하지 않게 하고,
    가입 완료(pending → active) 여부를 잠근 행 기준으로 판단
  end note
  alt user.name = null 이고 요청에 name 없음
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Name is required
  end

  Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPkWithLatestProfile(userPk, tx)
  StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student + 가장 큰 version 의 student_profile\n+ 학과 + 첨부(sort_order 순)
  PostgreSQL --> StudentRepository: row
  StudentRepository --> Service: { student, latest | null }

  Service -> DepartmentRepository: findByPkAndEmailDomain(department_id, student.email 의 @ 뒤, tx)
  DepartmentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT d.* FROM department d JOIN school s ON s.pk = d.school_pk\nWHERE d.pk = ? AND s.email_domain = ?
  PostgreSQL --> DepartmentRepository: row
  DepartmentRepository --> Service: department | null
  alt 없는 학과이거나 다른 학교의 학과
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Department does not belong to your school
  end

  alt latest = null (첫 저장) 또는 학과 · interests · activities · attachments 중 하나라도 다름
    note right of Service
      비교 기준: interests · attachments 는 순서까지 같아야 같음,
      activities 는 없음 = 빈 배열, attachment 는 kind · source · url · file_name
    end note
    Service -> ProfileRepository: insert({ studentPk, version: (latest?.version ?? 0) + 1,\ndepartmentPk, interests, activities }, tx)
    ProfileRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT student_profile RETURNING pk
    note right: UNIQUE (student_pk, version)
    opt attachments 있음
      Service -> AttachmentRepository: insertMany(profilePk, attachments, tx)
      AttachmentRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT student_profile_attachment\n(sort_order = 배열 순서)
    end
  else 바뀐 내용 없음
    note over Service: 새 버전을 만들지 않음
  end
  note right of Service: 이전 버전은 커피챗 요청이 참조하므로 수정 · 삭제하지 않음

  Service -> ContactRepository: upsert({ userPk, emailEnabled, kakaoEnabled, email, phone }, tx)
  ContactRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT coffee_chat_contact ...\nON CONFLICT (user_pk) DO UPDATE SET ..., updated_at = now()
  note right: 연락 설정은 버전 관리 안 함.\n끈 방법의 email / phone은 보내도 null로 저장.\nCHECK(kakao → phone, email → email)

  opt user.name = null
    Service -> UserRepository: fillName(userPk, name, tx)
    UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE users SET name = COALESCE(name, ?)
    note right: 한 번 저장한 이름은 수정 불가 (이후 보낸 name 은 무시)
  end

  opt user.status = pending (이번 호출로 가입 완료)
    Service -> UserRepository: activate(userPk, tx)
    UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE users SET status = 'active', updated_at = now()
    Service -> AuthService: issueTokens({ ...user, status: "active" }, tx)
    AuthService -> PostgreSQL: INSERT refresh_token, UPDATE users.last_active_at
    AuthService --> Service: { accessToken, refreshToken }
    note right of AuthService
      기존 refresh token 은 폐기하지 않음 (갱신 때 DB 의 status 로
      클레임을 다시 만듦). 클라이언트는 새 토큰으로 교체
    end note
  end
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답

alt 가입 완료
  Service --> Controller: { result: "OK", access_token, refresh_token }
  Controller --> Client: 201 { result: "OK", access_token, refresh_token }
else 마이페이지 수정 (이미 active)
  Service --> Controller: BaseResultDto.OK
  Controller --> Client: 201 { result: "OK" }
end

@enduml
